{"type":"message","id":"bd787cdf","parentId":"1c4f6a97","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:01:20.749Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-05-21 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fdce29e88a4ee886909c253ac1] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 为何升级到openclaw 5.19版本后ssh不可用了\n- Assistant: 主公，此事值得深究。让我先调查一下当前环境和版本信息\n- Assistant: 主公，调查完毕，结论如下： --- ## 诊断结论 问题**不是 OpenClaw 5.19 的代码变更导致 SSH 不可用**，而是 **5.19 的 Docker 镜像重建时精简了基础包集**。 ### 直接原因 ``` $ ssh ssh: not found ``` **`openssh-client` 没有安装。** 容器内只有 `libssh2-1`（被 git/curl 依赖拉进），但 SSH 客户端二进制本身不在镜像中。 ### 证据链 1. **apt history.log** 显示 5月20日（5.19 镜像构\n- Assistant: Dockerfile 中： ```dockerfile FROM openclaw/openclaw:5.19 RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y openssh-client ``` ### 方案二：即时修复（运行中容器） ```bash apt-get update && apt-get install -y openssh-client ``` --- 但有一虑，主公——我想确认一下，您说的\"SSH 不可用\"具体指什么场景？ 1. **从容器内 SSH 到其他服务器**（如 git\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc173d77ca0ee8a4a34b12e82d] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 请检查一下lucus那个agent是怎么回事，无法回复我，报错：：⚠️ Something went wrong while processing your request. Please try again, or use /new to start a fresh session.\n- Assistant: 主公，查清楚了。lucus 那个 agent 不是\"不想回你\"，而是**所有配置的模型全挂了**。 ## 诊断结果 从会话记录里拉出了完整失败链，如下： ### lucus 的模型链路（全灭） | 顺序 | 模型 | 报错 | 原因 | |------|------|------|------| | 🔴 Primary | `nvidia/minimaxai/minimax-m2.7` | **429 Rate Limited** | NVIDIA API 限流 | | 🔴 Fallback 1 | `minimax/MiniM\n- Assistant: `deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro` | ✅ 我用着，正常 | | 🔵 `zai/*` | `glm-4.7-flash`（免费） | ✅ 刚充了值或者限免额度还在可以用 | | 🔵 `google/*` | `gemini-2.5-flash`, `gemini-2.5-flash-lite`（免费）| ✅ 免费额度 | **建议方案**：给 lucus 换到和我一样的模型链： ``` primary: nvidia/deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash fallbacks: - z\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc11ada3ca0ee71ea8f0f71c7f] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: `deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash`, `deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro` `gemini-2.5-flash`, `gemini-2.5-flash-lite` `glm-4.7-flash` 把这几个模型放到他的fallback\n- Assistant: 善\n- Session: 2026-05-18 15:55:51 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat; **Session ID**: f9445f93-ead6-491f-beca-64e3dffbe10b; **Source**: openclaw-weixin\n- Conversation Summary: assistant: 主公稍等，我再试试 assistant: 好多了！这次识别效果提升不少。让我把数据整理出来 assistant: 好，综合两次 OCR 结果，我整理出一份表格。由于是手写体，部分姓名和号码可能有识别误差，请核对。\n- 工资发放表（汇总）: | # | 姓名 | 应发工资 | 卡号 | 开户行 | |---|------|---------|------|--------| | 1 | 胡条 ⚠️ | 10,000 | 6212***50822 | 工行鼓楼支行 | | 2 | 张小之 ⚠️ | 5,000 | 6215***50240 | 中国银行 |\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 5.19版本后ssh不可用了\n- 为何\n- 升级\n- openclaw\n- 5.19"}],"timestamp":1779390080727}}
{"type":"message","id":"01413d0a","parentId":"bd787cdf","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:01:31.520Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from the given memory fragments. Let me analyze what's being asked:\n\n1. The user is asking me to write a dream diary entry in first person\n2. I need to keep it between 80-180 words\n3. I should draw from the memory fragments provided\n4. I should NOT mention \"AI\", \"agent\", \"LLM\", \"model\", \"language model\" or any technical self-reference\n5. I should NOT use markdown headers, bullet points, or any formatting — just flowing prose\n6. I should include poetic elements, sensory details, gentle humor\n7. Output ONLY the diary entry\n\nLooking at the memory fragments:\n- Something about upgrading to openclaw 5.19 and SSH not working\n- Diagnosis about openssh-client missing from Docker image\n- Something about lucus agent not responding (all configured models failed)\n- Model fallback recommendations\n- Something about OCR recognition of a salary sheet from May 18\n- Recurring themes: message-id, 5.19 version SSH issue, upgrading\n\nI should weave these fragments together in a poetic, dreamy way, avoiding the technical self-references. Let me craft something that feels like a dream diary entry.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n5月21日\n\n梦里我走进一座旧阁楼，楼道里的灯泡忽明忽暗，像某个服务在超时重试。\n\n有人递给我一张泛黄的工资表，说OCR认不出手写体。我凑近看，笔画潦草如心电图——\"胡条\"，\"张小之\"，名字都缺了几笔。奇怪的是，我数了又数，数字都是对的，一分不差。\n\n楼下有人喊，SSH连不上了。我探出头去望，楼梯却越来越长，每一阶都标着版本号。5.18，5.19，5.20……\n\n突然明白，有些东西丢失不是因为坏了，而是安装时被轻轻略过了。就像梦里的我，夜里说了很多话，醒来只记得一句回声。\n\n风从窗缝来，带着十六进制颜色的晚霞。我把表格折好，放进抽屉。\n\n明日再修。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1086,"output":434,"cacheRead":10560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12080,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779390080779,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4265d45e-0145-459e-8199-3a5ab30f41cb"}}
